From fa355c8441892ceecd7d49337513d7bb2dd170b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guilhem Bichot <guilhem.bichot@contributor>

Date: Wed, 10 Sep 2025 15:06:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] decrease the memory footprint of session
 plan cache.

This is the first commit of a series.

Adding a status variable to show the number of invalidations of
cached plans.

Can be queried with
SHOW STATUS LIKE "Cached_plan_invalidations"

It is a global value (count of all invalidations of all connections
since startup), like Cached_plan_count (count of all currently cached
plans of all connections).

This is useful to document what happens in mtr testing, and also when
trying to understand performance issues in benchmarks.
